<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41848" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rōrātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		roro, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a falling of dew</i>, <i>dew.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 8, 2,
				2</span></i>.—In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nocturnae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 9, p. 232, 6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The falling off of the grape in consequence of a
				cold dew</i> (<i>a disease of the grapes</i>),
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				17, 24, 37, § 226</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A dropping in the clepsydra</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Cassiod. Var. 1, 48</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
